  "title": "Pear Preserves",
  "description": "These pear preserves are perfect to make when you have a surplus of pears. Fresh and candied ginger and lemon zest add a deliciously refreshing flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "Rachel"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:50:59-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2024-09-25T15:14:09-04:00",
  "prep_time": "PT30M",
  "cook_time": "PT45M",
  "total_time": "PT195M",
  "yield": [
    "48",
    "6 (1/2-pint) jars"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Jam / Jelly"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "American"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "American"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "3 pounds pears - peeled, cored, and chopped",
    "4 cups white sugar",
    "0.5 cup chopped crystallized ginger",
    "1 tablespoon fresh lemon juice",
    "2 teaspoons minced fresh ginger",
    "1 teaspoon lemon zest"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ptykwip9-OZZ_lZSe7B4ZJJ0xZ8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-228622-peppy-pear-preserves-VAT-step-01-34247390c4f64f6ca68a9484bfd5320b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228622/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix chopped pears with sugar, crystallized ginger, lemon juice, fresh ginger, and lemon zest in a large heavy pot; let the mixture stand for 2 hours for pears to release their juice.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UD3SE0SvO1ZmTHpnFYOaKW-9z7k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-228622-peppy-pear-preserves-VAT-step-02-e3300ace0b614014ae3d92f3ac87436d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228622/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the pot over medium-high heat, bring to a boil; cook, stirring often, until preserves are thick and fall off a metal spoon in sheets, 45 minutes to 1 hour. Pear pieces will be translucent and preserves will be darkened.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_yaRRg8oqBXIv8Imk14jHqvxdTg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-228622-peppy-pear-preserves-VAT-step-03-5e04d1aee35941359152664286214efe.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228622/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sterilize the jars and lids in boiling water for at least 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fL__uRDiB746j_2JVPnfNYw73lQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-228622-peppy-pear-preserves-VAT-step-04-a64da76fdc684b9eb715f6a25ee47f15.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228622/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pack the pear preserves into the hot, sterilized jars, filling the jars to within 1/4 inch of the top. Run a knife or a thin spatula around the insides of the jars after they have been filled to remove any air bubbles. Wipe the rims of the jars with a moist paper towel to remove any food residue. Top with lids, and screw on rings.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/beCJ9ZKzj9qeEVYQFfgx4S04XQk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-228622-peppy-pear-preserves-VAT-step-05-1-26dcebd1107042d797b11fe0dd1b4c86.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228622/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place a rack in the bottom of a large stockpot and fill halfway with water. Bring to a boil and lower jars into the boiling water using a holder. Leave a 2-inch space between the jars. Pour in more boiling water if necessary to bring the water level to at least 1 inch above the tops of the jars. Bring the water to a rolling boil, cover the pot, and process for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WYZIeWSMtKivD3DMm_Ru03jAM7I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-228622-peppy-pear-preserves-VAT-step-06-48e2429207754670a37b8e0089d5c91b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228622/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the jars from the stockpot and place onto a cloth-covered or wood surface, several inches apart, until cool. Once cool, press the top of each lid with a finger, ensuring that the seal is tight (lid does not move up or down at all). Store in a cool, dark area.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/t4kQoumiHT5MQdQluGd50vRByM0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-228622-peppy-pear-preserves-VAT-step-07-1-558fca51983c4c2f81425af27c28352a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228622/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
